  "id": "analysis-of-covariance",
  "term": "analysis of covariance",
  "definition": "Analysis of covariance is a statistical method for comparing groups on a quantitative outcome while also accounting for differences in a quantitative covariate that may affect that outcome. It is used to make group comparisons more sensitive by adjusting for relevant accompanying variation.",
